# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MKCGSPANDAN mobile app — example environment file
# Nothing here is secret. EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into the app
# bundle, so never put passwords, JWT secrets or API keys in this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Address of the existing MKCGSPANDAN API (the Express server in backend/),
# without the /api/v1 suffix.
#
#   Android emulator   http://10.0.2.2:5000        (10.0.2.2 = the computer running the emulator)
#   Physical phone     http://<computer LAN IP>:5000, or an https tunnel
#   Production         https://api.your-domain.example
#
# In development you may leave it empty: the app then uses the computer that
# serves the JavaScript bundle (the Expo dev server) on port 5000.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://mkcg-spandan.onrender.com

# Public address of the MKCGSPANDAN website (https://…, no trailing slash).
# Used by the "Explore MKCGSPANDAN on the Web" card on Home and the link to the
# full Community Guidelines. Leave empty until the site is live — the Home card
# then shows "Coming soon" and opens nothing. Compiled into the app: rebuild
# (or publish an update) after changing it.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_URL=
